%N A084966 Minimum numbers of squares needed to write n! as a sum of nonzero squares.
%H A084966 Antti Karttunen, <a href="/A084966/b084966.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..10000</a>
%H A084966 Dario Alpern, <a href="https://www.alpertron.com.ar/FSQUARES.HTM">Sum of squares web application</a>
%F A084966 a(n) = A002828(A000142(n)). - _Antti Karttunen_, Nov 26 2026
%e A084966 a(2)=2 because 2!=1^2+1^2; a(3)=3: 3!=6=2^2+1+1; a(6)=2: 6!=720=24^2+12^2
%o A084966 (C) // See link.
%o A084966 (PARI)
%o A084966 istwo(n:int) = { my(f); if(n<3, return(n>=0); ); f=factor(n>>valuation(n, 2)); for(i=1, #f[, 1], if(bitand(f[i, 2], 1)==1&&bitand(f[i, 1], 3)==3, return(0))); 1 };
%o A084966 isthree(n:int) = { my(tmp=valuation(n, 2)); bitand(tmp, 1)||bitand(n>>tmp, 7)!=7 };
%o A084966 A002828(n) = if(isthree(n), if(issquare(n), !!n, 3-istwo(n)), 4); \\ _Charles R Greathouse IV_, Jul 19 2011, revised Mar 17 2022
%o A084966 A084966(n) = A002828(n!); \\ _Antti Karttunen_, Nov 26 2026, based on _Charles R Greathouse IV_'s program for A002828 given above.
%Y A084966 Cf. A000142, A002828, A001481, A000419, A004215, A084953.
%K A084966 nonn,changed
%O A084966 1,2
%A A084966 _Hugo Pfoertner_, Jun 15 2003
